{"word":"εὔφημος","uri":"euphêmos","senses":[{"word":"εὔφημος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">εὔ·φημος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος,\nον</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> au sens\nreligieux :\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui prononce des paroles\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> pousse des cris de bon augure\n(<span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">δύσφημος</span>) <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\nl’aigle,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">H.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">9, 32, 3</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">d’ord.</span> qui évite les paroles de mauvais augure,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> qui garde un silence religieux,\n<span class=\"ital\">dans les Trag.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.C.</span> <span class=\"refch\">132 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">εὔφημα φώνει,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Aj.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">362, 591 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">I.T.</span> <span class=\"refch\">687 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">εὔφημος\nἴσθι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">fr.\n426,</span> garde un religieux silence ; <span class=\"ital\">p.\next.</span> saint, sacré (maison, chant, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Andr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1144 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">801</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> qui emploie un mot\nfavorable au lieu d’un mot de mauvais augure ; <span class=\"ital\">p. suite,</span> qui parle par euphémisme, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">2 Alc.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">140</